msgstr "Reguleer Utdruck, mit den de Element-Typ söcht warrt"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui line 245
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui line 285
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui line 245
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui line 285
#: rc.cpp:194 rc.cpp:228
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Regular expression to find the type of the element. The pattern is searched "
"on the result of the <i>DefinitionRx</i> match and the first captured area "
"will hold the element type.<br>\n"
"Example (simplified):<br>\n"
"<b>DefinitionRx=\\$+([a-zA-Z]+)=new\\\\s[a-zA-Z]+;<br>\n"
"TypeRx=new\\\\s([a-zA-Z]+);</b><br><br>\n"
"This will match strings like <b>$fooObj=new foo;</b>. Now this string is "
"searched and it will find <b>new foo;</b>, where <b>foo</b> is the first "
"captured text (the regular expression matching <b>foo</b> is between "
"brackets).<br>\n"
"So the type of <b>$fooObj</b> is <b>foo</b>."
msgstr ""
"Reguleer Utdruck, mit den de Element-Typ söcht warrt. Dat Muster warrt na't "
"Resultaat vun den <i>DefinitionRx</i>-Dreper dörsöcht un dat toeerst passen "
"Rebeet bargt den Element-Typ.<br>\n"
"Bispeel (vereenfacht):<br>\n"
"<b>DefinitionRx=\\$+([a-zA-Z]+)=new\\\\s[a-zA-Z]+;<br>\n"
"TypeRx=new\\\\s([a-zA-Z]+);</b><br><br>\n"
"Dat passt op Tekenkeden liek <b>$fooObj=new foo;</b>. Nu warrt na disse "
"Tekenkeed söcht un <b>new foo;</b> funnen, wo <b>foo</b> de toeerst passen "
"Text is (de op <b>foo</b> passen reguleer Utdruck is in Klemmen) is.<br>\n"
"So is Typ vun <b>$fooObj</b> <b>foo</b>."

